Operations' two additions aren't included. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`, scoped to four hosts. That gives it no filesystem access, so it can't append to `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log`. `metadata.internal.example` isn't on the allowlist either, and a request there would trap and fail the whole run. If operations needs either one, the node's declared authority has to be widened in the graph first.

